{"id":"dognat_","lemma":"догнать","pos":"verb","rank":3933,"glosses":["to catch up, to overtake","to drive to, to bring to"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/92/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"догоню","2s":"догонишь","3s":"догонит","1p":"догоним","2p":"догоните","3p":"догонят"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"догони","2p":"догоните"}}},"past":{"m":"догнал","p":"догнали","f":"догнала","n":"догнало"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"догонять","examples":[{"text":"Иди-иди, я догоню.","en":"Go on. I'll catch up.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Я наконец догнал друзей.","en":"At last, I caught up with my friends.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"at last, finally"},null,{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]},{"text":"Я догоню тебя скоро.","en":"I'll catch up with you soon.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"soon"}]},{"text":"Мы тебя потом догоним.","en":"We'll catch up with you later.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"afterwards"},null]},{"text":"Думаю, он нас скоро догонит.","en":"I think he will soon catch up with us.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"soon"},null]}]}